function normalizeSavedState(raw){const source=isPlainRecord(raw)?raw:{},next={...defaultState(),...source};for(const key of ['visited','completed','order','logs','evidence'])if(!Array.isArray(next[key]))next[key]=defaultState()[key];next.clues=isPlainRecord(next.clues)?next.clues:{};next.tasks=isPlainRecord(next.tasks)?next.tasks:{};for(const [key,value] of Object.entries(next.tasks))if(!isPlainRecord(value))next.tasks[key]={};for(const era of eras.map(item=>item.id))if(!Array.isArray(next.clues[era]))next.clues[era]=[];if(!Number.isFinite(next.quizBest)||next.quizBest<0)next.quizBest=0;return next}
